config ZMK_RGB_LAYER_INDICATOR
    bool "Recolor RGB underglow to indicate the active layer"
    depends on ZMK_RGB_UNDERGLOW
    default n
    help
      When enabled, the RGB underglow is recolored on every layer change to a
      per-layer color (layer 0 turns it off). Lights the central half; see
      src/rgb_layer_indicator.c for the split-keyboard caveat.
